# Filter configuration
# Note: Filters are stored in memory based on Name, if another filter file is loaded with the same Name statement, it overrides the existing filter

# Assign properties
Name Default instamute text filter
Description This filter contains slurs and other words that result in a mute
Reason Filtered for offensive behaviour, slurs and similar insults are not allowed.

# Severity can be ALWAYS_FILTERED, USER_STRICT_MODE and INSTAMUTE
Severity INSTAMUTE

#
# Define phrases
# Phrases can be defined with `Phrase phrase here`, eg `Phrase example`
# Phrase bodies look like this:
#    # Define example
#    Phrase example
#        # Note: text filters, while processing, ignore any non-alphanumeric characters, keep that in mind while writing down variants
#
#        # Set filtering mode, they can be:
#        #   WHOLE_PHRASE : filters only if the whole phrase is a match, this does not tag unless all words are on their own, unless its a single word, then it checks if the word is present in the sentence, doesnt work if attached to another word, eg. `exam` and `example` arent a match to the system
#        #   PHRASE_COMBINED : similar to WHOLE_PHRASE but also filters if the phrase without spaces is present in the text
#        #   WORD_CONTAINS : most recommended in most cases, filters only if a word contains the phrase or variant, unlike WHOLE_PHRASE this DOES tag if the filter words are present attached to other words
#        #   WORD_COMBINED : similar to WORD_CONTAINS but also filters if the phrase without spaces is present in the text
#        Mode WHOLE_PHRASE
#
#        # Define variants
#        # Same rules as initial definition
#        Variant ex4mple
#
#        # Filtering reason (optional)
#        Reason Example filter
#    # Endphrase marks the end of the phrase
#    Endphrase
#
# There wont be commenting much after this because writing filters ABSOLUTELY SUCKS due to all the words that are defined youd prefer not to read
#


Phrase nigger
    Mode WORD_CONTAINS
    Variant n1gger
    Variant n1gg3r
    Variant nigg3r
    Variant nigga
    Variant n1gg4
    Variant nigg4
    Variant n1gg4
Endphrase

Phrase nigger
    Mode WHOLE_PHRASE
    Variant nigg
    Variant n1gg
    Variant n1g
    Variant nig
Endphrase

Phrase faggot
    Mode WORD_CONTAINS
    Variant f4ggot
    Variant fagg0t
    Variant f4gg0t
    Variant fa99ot
    Variant fa990t
Endphrase

Phrase faggot
    Mode WHOLE_PHRASE
    Variant fag
    Variant f4g
Endphrase

Phrase beaner
    Mode WORD_CONTAINS
    Variant b3eaner
    Variant b3e4n3r
    Variant b3ean3r
    Variant be4ner
Endphrase

Phrase retard
    Mode WORD_CONTAINS
    Variant retarded
    Variant ret4rded
    Variant ret4rd
    Variant r3t4rded
    Variant r3t4rd
    Variant r3tarded
    Variant r3tard3d
    Variant r3t4rd3d
    Variant ret4rded
    Variant ret4rd3d
    Variant r3tard
Endphrase

Phrase tranny
    Mode WORD_CONTAINS
    Variant tr4nny
Endphrase

Phrase cripple
    Mode WHOLE_PHRASE
    Variant cripple
    Variant cr1pple
    Variant cr1ppled
Endphrase

Phrase crippled
    Mode WHOLE_PHRASE
    Severity ALWAYS_FILTERED
    Variant crippled
    Reason While there are innocent uses, the phrase crippled has been used offensively, which is why we ask you to avoid the phrase.
Endphrase

Phrase ching chong
    Mode WHOLE_PHRASE
    Variant chingchong
Endphrase

Phrase dyke
    Mode WHOLE_PHRASE
    Variant dyk3
Endphrase

Phrase beaner
    Mode WHOLE_PHRASE
    Variant bean3r
Endphrase
